  "description": "<ul><li><strong>Effect:</strong> A <strong>10ft</strong> aura of divine power, on whenever you are conscious, that cannot be dispelled.</li><li>You and your allies within it have <strong>Advantage</strong> on <strong>Will saves</strong>; if your deity already gives you <strong>Advantage</strong> on a save the aura covers, your aura reaches <strong>10ft</strong> further instead.</li><li>Undead anywhere in your Turn Undead's reach have <strong>Disadvantage</strong> on their saves against it.</li><li>15th level: the aura grows to <strong>20ft</strong>. You and your allies within it are immune to instant-death effects, as Death Ward, and have <strong>Advantage</strong> on all saves, not <strong>Will saves</strong> only.</li></ul>",
